# CoreForge Cloudflare Pages Redirect Rules
# Non-www to www redirect (single-hop 301)
https://coreforgeindia.com/* https://www.coreforgeindia.com/:splat 301
http://coreforgeindia.com/* https://www.coreforgeindia.com/:splat 301

# Company → About consolidation (301 permanent redirect)
/company /about 301

# Products → Services redirect (301 permanent redirect)
/products /services 301
